  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Let Me Roll It** (1 review): Listener described this specific track as a treat they had not heard often [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Let Me Roll It**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Bananas n' Blow**: back after 233 archived shows (2312 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2006-09-17.mk4v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 64 min; rated 4.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Music sounds distant, with loud shouting from the crowd near the taping device [5]\n- **ween2006-09-17.mk4v.flac24**: source not stated; 16 songs; 64 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer stood in the front row to witness the live performance [3]\n- Band members appeared happy to be performing back in their home state [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2006-09-17.mk4v.flac16**: taped by Silky Desconocido; transferred by Silky Desconocido; source: schoeps mk4v > vms02ib > edirol r9 (24/48) [1]. Also: Uploader provided a 16-bit fileset intended specifically for audio CD burning [1]\n- **ween2006-09-17.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Silky Desconocido; transferred by Silky Desconocido; source: schoeps mk4v > vms02ib > edirol r9 (24/48) [2]. Also: Uploader provided a 24-bit fileset not intended for audio CD use [2]",
